" begin="00:37.416" end="00:39.680"><span begin="00:37.416" end="00:37.620">Off </span><span begin="00:37.620" end="00:38.218">third </span><span begin="00:38.218" end="00:39.680">avenue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.073" end="00:43.214"><span begin="00:41.073" end="00:41.261">It </span><span begin="00:41.261" end="00:41.797">lingers </span><span begin="00:41.797" end="00:42.167">on </span><span begin="00:42.167" end="00:42.443">my </span><span begin="00:42.443" end="00:43.214">chest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.354" end="00:46.654"><span begin="00:44.354" end="00:44.552">'Cause </span><span begin="00:44.552" end="00:44.749">I'm </span><span begin="00:44.749" end="00:45.236">longing </span><span begin="00:45.236" end="00:45.629">for </span><span begin="00:45.629" end="00:45.850">the </span><span begin="00:45.850" end="00:46.654">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.006" end="00:50.223"><span begin="00:48.006" end="00:48.203">Our </span><span begin="00:48.203" end="00:48.580">roads </span><span begin="00:48.580" end="00:48.807">would </span><span begin="00:48.807" end="00:50.223">intersect</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.176" end="00:53.647"><span begin="00:51.176" end="00:51.356">And </span><span begin="00:51.356" end="00:51.556">our </span><span begin="00:51.556" end="00:51.963">lives </span><span begin="00:51.963" end="00:53.647">intertwine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.898" end="01:02.593"><span begin="00:54.898" end="00:55.078">But </span><span begin="00:55.078" end="00:55.764">I'm </span><span begin="00:55.764" end="00:56.574">so </span><span begin="00:56.574" end="00:57.580">scared </span><span begin="00:57.580" end="00:58.313">of </span><span begin="00:58.313" end="01:00.097">holding </span><span begin="01:00.097" end="01:00.915">on </span><span begin="01:00.915" end="01:01.357">to </span><span begin="01:01.357" end="01:02.593">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.851" end="01:05.622"><span begin="01:02.851" end="01:03.064">Guess </span><span begin="01:03.064" end="01:04.267">I'll </span><span begin="01:04.267" end="01:04.754">see </span><span begin="01:04.754" end="01:05.622">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.909" end="01:10.090"><span begin="01:07.909" end="01:08.202">In </span><span begin="01:08.202" end="01:08.884">another </span><span begin="01:08.884" end="01:10.090">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.244" end="01:13.487"><span begin="01:11.244" end="01:11.466">I'll </span><span begin="01:11.466" end="01:11.663">look </span><span begin="01:11.663" end="01:12.094">you </span><span begin="01:12.094" end="01:12.323">in </span><span begin="01:12.323" end="01:12.606">the </span><span begin="01:12.606" end="01:13.487">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.560" end="01:17.128"><span begin="01:15.560" end="01:15.809">There </span><span begin="01:15.809" end="01:16.076">she </span><span begin="01:16.076" end="01:16.413">goes </span><span begin="01:16.413" end="01:17.128">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.947" end="01:20.907"><span begin="01:18.947" end="01:19.221">When </span><span begin="01:19.221" end="01:19.545">she </span><span begin="01:19.545" end="01:20.098">passes </span><span begin="01:20.098" end="01:20.907">by</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.196" end="01:24.592"><span begin="01:22.196" end="01:22.378">The </span><span begin="01:22.378" end="01:22.746">birds </span><span begin="01:22.746" end="01:23.440">begin </span><span begin="01:23.440" end="01:23.730">to </span><span begin="01:23.730" end="01:24.592">sing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.509" end="01:28.305"><span begin="01:25.509" end="01:25.698">But </span><span begin="01:25.698" end="01:25.887">I </span><span begin="01:25.887" end="01:26.430">wouldn't </span><span begin="01:26.430" end="01:26.902">dare </span><span begin="01:26.902" end="01:27.123">to </span><span begin="01:27.123" end="01:28.305">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="0