</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.821" end="01:54.006"><span begin="01:50.821" end="01:51.037">Guess </span><span begin="01:51.037" end="01:52.332">I'll </span><span begin="01:52.332" end="01:52.803">see </span><span begin="01:52.803" end="01:54.006">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.007" end="01:57.634"><span begin="01:56.007" end="01:56.234">In </span><span begin="01:56.234" end="01:57.037">another </span><span begin="01:57.037" end="01:57.634">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.109" end="02:01.284"><span begin="01:59.109" end="01:59.301">I'll </span><span begin="01:59.301" end="01:59.647">look </span><span begin="01:59.647" end="01:59.994">you </span><span begin="01:59.994" end="02:00.191">in </span><span begin="02:00.191" end="02:00.458">the </span><span begin="02:00.458" end="02:01.284">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.655" end="02:03.220"><span begin="02:01.655" end="02:01.828">And </span><span begin="02:01.828" end="02:02.748">tell </span><span begin="02:02.748" end="02:03.220">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.607" end="02:07.807"><span begin="02:03.607" end="02:04.559">How </span><span begin="02:04.559" end="02:05.251">I've </span><span begin="02:05.251" end="02:05.951">looked </span><span begin="02:05.951" end="02:06.572">for </span><span begin="02:06.572" end="02:07.807">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.484" end="02:11.504"><span begin="02:08.484" end="02:08.673">There's </span><span begin="02:08.673" end="02:08.972">not </span><span begin="02:08.972" end="02:09.246">much </span><span begin="02:09.246" end="02:09.492">more </span><span begin="02:09.492" end="02:09.862">my </span><span begin="02:09.862" end="02:10.120">heart </span><span begin="02:10.120" end="02:10.749">can </span><span begin="02:10.749" end="02:11.504">take</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.025" end="02:14.903"><span begin="02:12.025" end="02:12.205">I'll </span><span begin="02:12.205" end="02:12.440">tell </span><span begin="02:12.440" end="02:12.685">you </span><span begin="02:12.685" end="02:12.915">what </span><span begin="02:12.915" end="02:13.236">I </span><span begin="02:13.236" end="02:13.960">couldn't </span><span begin="02:13.960" end="02:14.903">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.361" end="02:17.973"><span begin="02:15.361" end="02:15.557">On </span><span begin="02:15.557" end="02:16.258">third </span><span begin="02:16.258" end="02:17.973">avenue</span></p></div></body></tt>